{"2475010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pizza Bandit", "steam_appid": 2475010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pizza Bandit is a mission-based 4-player online co-op third-person PvE shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A former bounty hunter finally buys the pizza shop he's always wanted—only to find it empty. To build it, he'll have to pick up the guns again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/1b7428dec7952390017d6d6a41087966.poster.avif?t=1781740697\" width=650 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/1b7428dec7952390017d6d6a41087966.webm?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/1b7428dec7952390017d6d6a41087966.mp4?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔥 Close-Quarters Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles unfold in tight spaces where movement is survival. Time your dodge-rolls, manage your stamina, and find firing angles as enemy hordes close in. Positioning and teamwork determine whether your squad extracts—or gets wiped. Friendly fire is always on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/82e88be78d92293fb5506fdf66111dd0.poster.avif?t=1781740697\" width=650 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/82e88be78d92293fb5506fdf66111dd0.webm?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/82e88be78d92293fb5506fdf66111dd0.mp4?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍳 Cooking Under Fire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking isn't a side activity—it's a mission objective. Fail to complete orders, and the mission fails. Prepare meals under enemy pressure. Every second spent plating is a second you're exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/2d2d98dd1620e46f35dc30dcff6874d9.poster.avif?t=1781740697\" aria-label=\"cooking under fire\" width=650 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/2d2d98dd1620e46f35dc30dcff6874d9.webm?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/2d2d98dd1620e46f35dc30dcff6874d9.mp4?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔫 Loadout &amp; Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission starts with your loadout. Choose weapons, gadgets, and abilities that shape how you fight. Complete contracts to unlock stronger gear and new build options for tougher missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/34ca0772a6bfdca6bbd2a7985ade4615.poster.avif?t=1781740697\" aria-label=\"Loadouts\" width=650 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/34ca0772a6bfdca6bbd2a7985ade4615.webm?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/34ca0772a6bfdca6bbd2a7985ade4615.mp4?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍽️ Build the Dream</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, invest your earnings into the pizzeria you're trying to bring to life. Upgrade equipment, decorate the space, and turn an empty shop into something worth fighting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/b38423e56b745ac716055ee040333bd9.poster.avif?t=1781740697\" width=650 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/b38423e56b745ac716055ee040333bd9.webm?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/b38423e56b745ac716055ee040333bd9.mp4?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🤝 1–4 Player Online Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or squad up with up to four players online. Missions scale to your squad size, but tight spaces and friendly fire demand real coordination. Coordination is survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚧 Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pizza Bandit is currently in Early Access. The core combat and mission systems are fully playable, and we're actively expanding the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upcoming updates are planned to include new mission sets, enemy variants, and mission modifiers that alter rules, difficulty, and environments—alongside expanded loadouts and deeper restaurant progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're building this alongside the community, and feedback directly shapes future updates.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pizza Bandit is a mission-based 4-player online co-op third-person PvE shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A former bounty hunter finally buys the pizza shop he's always wanted—only to find it empty. To build it, he'll have to pick up the guns again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/1b7428dec7952390017d6d6a41087966.poster.avif?t=1781740697\" width=650 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/1b7428dec7952390017d6d6a41087966.webm?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/1b7428dec7952390017d6d6a41087966.mp4?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔥 Close-Quarters Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles unfold in tight spaces where movement is survival. Time your dodge-rolls, manage your stamina, and find firing angles as enemy hordes close in. Positioning and teamwork determine whether your squad extracts—or gets wiped. Friendly fire is always on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/82e88be78d92293fb5506fdf66111dd0.poster.avif?t=1781740697\" width=650 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/82e88be78d92293fb5506fdf66111dd0.webm?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/82e88be78d92293fb5506fdf66111dd0.mp4?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍳 Cooking Under Fire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking isn't a side activity—it's a mission objective. Fail to complete orders, and the mission fails. Prepare meals under enemy pressure. Every second spent plating is a second you're exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/2d2d98dd1620e46f35dc30dcff6874d9.poster.avif?t=1781740697\" aria-label=\"cooking under fire\" width=650 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/2d2d98dd1620e46f35dc30dcff6874d9.webm?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/2d2d98dd1620e46f35dc30dcff6874d9.mp4?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔫 Loadout &amp; Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission starts with your loadout. Choose weapons, gadgets, and abilities that shape how you fight. Complete contracts to unlock stronger gear and new build options for tougher missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/34ca0772a6bfdca6bbd2a7985ade4615.poster.avif?t=1781740697\" aria-label=\"Loadouts\" width=650 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/34ca0772a6bfdca6bbd2a7985ade4615.webm?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/34ca0772a6bfdca6bbd2a7985ade4615.mp4?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍽️ Build the Dream</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, invest your earnings into the pizzeria you're trying to bring to life. Upgrade equipment, decorate the space, and turn an empty shop into something worth fighting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/b38423e56b745ac716055ee040333bd9.poster.avif?t=1781740697\" width=650 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/b38423e56b745ac716055ee040333bd9.webm?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/extras/b38423e56b745ac716055ee040333bd9.mp4?t=1781740697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🤝 1–4 Player Online Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or squad up with up to four players online. Missions scale to your squad size, but tight spaces and friendly fire demand real coordination. Coordination is survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚧 Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pizza Bandit is currently in Early Access. The core combat and mission systems are fully playable, and we're actively expanding the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upcoming updates are planned to include new mission sets, enemy variants, and mission modifiers that alter rules, difficulty, and environments—alongside expanded loadouts and deeper restaurant progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're building this alongside the community, and feedback directly shapes future updates.</p>", "short_description": "A 4-player online co-op third-person PvE shooter where intense combat meets high-pressure cooking. Battle hordes, coordinate your loadout, and cook under fire to build your pizza empire.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Italian, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Pizza Bandit is always ludicrous, and its inspirations are obvious, but it’s never less than fun.”<br>IGN<br><br>“There is not a moment in the game that is not just pure bliss and enjoyment.”<br>YardBarker<br><br>“Pizza Bandit is a silly concept that’s been executed at a delightfully high level, and I can’t wait to put on my dirty chef’s hat again!”<br>The Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/f47ce626d2918c47bd7e685b2457acdb6b1b8260/header.jpg?t=1781740697", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/140de03637428fe1a8bc9eba523070f3d3a7f664/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781740697", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475010/140de03637428fe1a8bc9eba523070f3d3a7f664/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781740697", "website": "https://bandit.pizza", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb